      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T21:25:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we\u0027ve been using int64_t or ptrdiff_t?\ni looked into types that are larger than int and long long is a candidate.\nin the future, if int were 128 bits, long long would likely be 256 bits.\nbut we\u0027ll likely need to do a cleanup and do things consistently, so i suggest change all int64_t to long long or this to int64_t",
      "revId": "614a71f21d79d95929ef38c45cacf397b1c11897",
